    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that feels like such a cope. \"cherishing the experience\" is just something people say to pretend the void isn't there. if nothing we do actually leaves a mark, if we're all just going to be erased by entropy anyway, then the struggle itself is just pointless suffering. why keep playing the game when the outcome is always zero? it feels like we're just clinging to these tiny little delusions to avoid admitting that we don't actually matter at all.",
